idends).","The share count has shrunk 2.9% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","It has paid a dividend for 21 consecutive years, though it has been cut 2.6% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 2,100 employees, each generates about $311K of revenue, 0.8x the Industrials median, and productivity has fallen 5.2% a year.","That works out to $57K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.0M (7x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $6K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":74,"head":"Watch: priced 22% above its $31.83 fair value, but that value is low-confidence and the price is inside its $25.65\u2013$40.39 range.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 42, gates 12/24)","ROIC 21.2% vs WACC 8.8%","FCF margin 18.3%","Net debt/EBITDA 0.1x","Altman Z in the safe zone"],"cons":["Trades 22% above fair value of $31.83"],"flags":[],"need":["no margin of safety"],"buy_below":27.06,"vc":{"base":31.83,"base_src":"dcf","bear":25.65,"bull":40.39,"alt_median":17.36,"n_alt":3,"gap":0.8332,"dispersion":0.3669,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (37% dispersion)","DCF is 83% above the other models' median ($17.36)"]},"med":{"pe":23.2692,"ev_ebitda":13.319,"pfcf":22.2778,"pb":3.0551,"roic":0.1001,"gross_margin":0.2851,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0147}},"ticker":"EPAC","date":"2026-11-06"}